1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 14]</font>

15
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Cui.</font>

16
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:18,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may leave us.</font>

17
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:20,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have matters
to discuss with Prince Duan.</font>

18
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:22,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I take my leave, Your Majesty.</font>

19
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You wish to ask about Princess Changle,
Your Majesty?</font>

20
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I remember</font>

21
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that she was inextricably tied</font>

22
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the hemp case back then.</font>

23
00:01:40,880 --> 00:01:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My eldest sister</font>

24
00:01:42,080 --> 00:01:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been much subdued
since she returned.</font>

25
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the calmer she appears,</font>

26
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the more unsettling it feels.</font>

27
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

28
00:01:50,360 --> 00:01:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we can use the hemp case</font>

29
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to charge Princess Changle,</font>

30
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you will grant me one wish.</font>

31
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is not impossible.</font>

32
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However...</font>

33
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, Your Majesty.</font>

34
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sister,</font>

35
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why must a flower be cut</font>

36
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as soon as it withers?</font>

37
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This dying bloom hasn't fully faded yet.</font>

38
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not pruned in time,</font>

39
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it will still compete for nutrients,</font>

40
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and soon the whole plant will wither.</font>

41
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only with timely pruning</font>

42
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can new buds bloom,
and flowers grow again.</font>

43
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When she worked for me,</font>

44
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she ate well and slept soundly.</font>

45
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever since she became your wife,</font>

46
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she got dragged into the fight
with Changle.</font>

47
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:29,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's been racking her brains</font>

48
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and nearly lost her life over it.</font>

49
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The case is almost closed now.</font>

50
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you have any conscience left...</font>

51
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm begging you.</font>

52
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let her go.</font>

53
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You went to the Palace today?</font>

54
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're still unwell,</font>

55
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and His Majesty
already assigned you more duties?</font>

56
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't be angry with me.</font>

57
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was wrong to act on my own.</font>

58
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shouldn't have kept it from you</font>

59
00:03:03,600 --> 00:03:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and harmed my body.</font>

60
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But as long as there's still
a sliver of hope,</font>

61
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to give up on any of it.</font>

62
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing. I'm nearly healed.</font>

63
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, I've been reading
some medical books lately.</font>

64
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found
several detoxification therapies.</font>

65
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can try them all next time.</font>

66
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:24,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

67
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you wish to see your mother,</font>

68
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can have someone escort you there.</font>

69
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you trying to send me away now?</font>

70
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do the promises made
at the Shangsi Festival mean nothing?</font>

71
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always act on a whim.</font>

72
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right now,
I simply don't want to see you.</font>

73
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is that okay?</font>

74
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a coincidence.</font>

75
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:50,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems you and I share
the same temperament.</font>

76
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For now,
I don't feel like leaving at all.</font>

77
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

78
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is all your luggage.</font>

79
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inside are some gold and silver coins.</font>

80
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough to live comfortably
without worry.</font>

81
00:04:58,960 --> 00:04:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From this day on,</font>

82
00:05:00,640 --> 00:05:01,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">leave my mansion.</font>

83
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:05,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was given to you by His Majesty.</font>

84
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether I go or not</font>

85
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not for you to decide.</font>

86
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're just trying to force me out.</font>

87
00:05:12,920 --> 00:05:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can see right</font>

88
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">through your mind.</font>

89
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's still hope now.</font>

90
00:05:21,080 --> 00:05:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why give up on yourself?</font>

91
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

92
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you truly this naive,</font>

93
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or do you underestimate
your family's cruelty?</font>

94
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since your parents
decided to use poison,</font>

95
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they resolved to eliminate
every last trace.</font>

96
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why keep up this pretense before me?</font>

97
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

98
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since you believe my parents harmed you,</font>

99
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:53,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must hold on for me.</font>

100
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Live to see the day</font>

101
00:05:54,840 --> 00:05:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I rescue my brother</font>

102
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the truth comes to light.</font>

103
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

104
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

105
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is the packing coming along?</font>

106
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

107
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What brings you here?</font>

108
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:06,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you not send for me?</font>

109
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said you no longer wished
to stay here,</font>

110
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I came to take you home.</font>

111
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Divorce Letter]</font>

112
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are hereby divorced by me.</font>

113
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan, Li Congyao,
favored Jun Qinglan.</font>

114
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet, Jun's stubborn nature</font>

115
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is incompatible with the Prince.</font>

116
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thus, this divorce letter is issued.</font>

117
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:47,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop reading.</font>

118
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Must it really come to this?</font>

119
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave.</font>

120
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out of my sight.</font>

121
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

122
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've gone too far.</font>

123
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, I'll leave.</font>

124
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think you're the only one
with a temper?</font>

125
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

126
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've had enough of your half-dead look</font>

127
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for a long time.</font>

128
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today, I've taken your divorce letter.</font>

129
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

130
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we go our separate ways in peace</font>

131
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and forget each other.</font>

132
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't come to my wedding.</font>

133
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I won't attend your funeral either.</font>

134
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

135
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's go.</font>

136
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Duke Dingguo's Mansion]</font>

137
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

138
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've risked everything for you.</font>

139
00:08:11,040 --> 00:08:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on.</font>

140
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why aren't you jumping? You coward.</font>

141
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only puppies jump through hoops.</font>

142
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't do it.</font>

143
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then admit you're a coward.</font>

144
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the coward.</font>

145
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the coward.</font>

146
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

147
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You coward.</font>

148
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan, you big coward.</font>

149
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You chubby coward.</font>

150
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the coward.</font>

151
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan.</font>

152
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're that little puppy.</font>

153
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop right there.</font>

154
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you calling a coward?</font>

155
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop it.</font>

156
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

157
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been silent</font>

158
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for a whole day.</font>

159
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:45,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

160
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dislike my acrobatics,</font>

161
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:49,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how about</font>

162
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I take you out for a walk</font>

163
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to clear your mind?</font>

164
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nonsense.</font>

165
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She should go handle cases.</font>

166
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A couple of days ago,
a student from Shangxue Academy</font>

167
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fell into a well and died.</font>

168
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one's taken the case yet.</font>

169
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop drinking.</font>

170
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you long ago</font>

171
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Prince Duan is unreliable.</font>

172
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you eager to leave there too?</font>

173
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're out now.</font>

174
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should be happy.</font>

175
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not upset he divorced me.</font>

176
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:20,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm upset he pushed me away
at a time like this.</font>

177
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, my.</font>

178
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:23,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He sent you away now,</font>

179
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">probably because he didn't want
to drag you down.</font>

180
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a surprise.</font>

181
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This sickly prince has some spine.</font>

182
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. You want a drink, right?</font>

183
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

184
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:38,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll join you.</font>

185
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We won't stop till we're drunk.</font>

186
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:43,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Count me in. I'll join you too.</font>

187
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get lost.</font>

188
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Deceiving me.</font>

189
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're both deceiving me.</font>

190
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

191
00:09:58,960 --> 00:09:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So annoying.</font>

192
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun and Jiang Yufan</font>

193
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be hiding something from me.</font>

194
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss.</font>

195
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss what?</font>

196
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My lady.</font>

197
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:23,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I already said...</font>

198
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A maiden's face
should be fair and clean.</font>

199
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you cry like this,</font>

200
00:10:40,880 --> 00:10:41,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your family would be heartbroken.</font>

201
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My apologies.</font>

202
00:10:46,520 --> 00:10:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've made a fool of myself before you.</font>

203
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for being too forward.</font>

204
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

205
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, it wasn't forward.</font>

206
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, what is your name?</font>

207
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My name is Jiang Ying.</font>

208
00:10:56,280 --> 00:10:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying, as in "Filling the waters".</font>

209
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Assassin!</font>

210
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun.</font>

211
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I forgot something.</font>

212
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came back to get it.</font>

213
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun.</font>

214
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince has been teaching
at Shangxue Academy lately.</font>

215
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is no longer here.</font>

216
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since when?</font>

217
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shangxue Academy]</font>

218
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They say the Prince
has great military achievements</font>

219
00:11:56,520 --> 00:11:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and kills without blinking
on the battlefield.</font>

220
00:11:58,560 --> 00:12:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he seems so gentle and meek.</font>

221
00:12:00,520 --> 00:12:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's in worse shape than I am.</font>

222
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan has a terminal illness.</font>

223
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's dying.</font>

224
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty took pity on him</font>

225
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and sent him to teach here.</font>

226
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They call it teaching,</font>

227
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but he's really just waiting to die.</font>

228
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A dying man is supposed to teach us?</font>

229
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This academy is unbearable.</font>

230
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:21,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, Sun Mingcheng died;</font>

231
00:12:21,080 --> 00:12:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then Cui Tai died.</font>

232
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And they bring in a dying man
to teach us.</font>

233
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a curse.</font>

234
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

235
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut your mouth.</font>

236
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such bad luck.</font>

237
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia.</font>

238
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

239
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To get some fresh air.</font>

240
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

241
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

242
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shangxue Academy]</font>

243
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who goes there?</font>

244
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm from Prince Duan's Mansion.</font>

245
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've brought something for the Prince.</font>

246
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're the Judicial Review coroner?</font>

247
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know me?</font>

248
00:13:00,160 --> 00:13:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's me.</font>

249
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of Yanjing knows</font>

250
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the Prince divorced you.</font>

251
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I not recognize you?</font>

252
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince gave strict orders.</font>

253
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one is allowed into Shangxue Academy,</font>

254
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lest they disturb his teaching.</font>

255
00:13:09,040 --> 00:13:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, go back.</font>

256
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir, please, make an exception.</font>

257
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just take a quick look inside.</font>

258
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once I see he's well, I'll leave.</font>

259
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:16,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you take this place for?</font>

260
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such disgraceful conduct.</font>

261
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I...</font>

262
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

263
00:13:19,800 --> 00:13:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Mr. Jiang.</font>

264
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I was here before,</font>

265
00:13:22,800 --> 00:13:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't see you being so aloof.</font>

266
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, you studied here?</font>

267
00:13:27,760 --> 00:13:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you get me inside?</font>

268
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I finished long ago. I can't enter.</font>

269
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you know him?</font>

270
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do we know each other?</font>

271
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are not acquainted.</font>

272
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You see?</font>

273
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

274
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:43,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's just go back.</font>

275
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:45,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, let's go.</font>

276
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

277
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan requested His Majesty</font>

278
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to teach at Shangxue Academy</font>

279
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to rest and recover.</font>

280
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You needn't worry about him anymore.</font>

281
00:13:58,040 --> 00:14:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, the Li Congyao you know</font>

282
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doesn't act
like a proper teacher at all.</font>

283
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if he's recovering from illness,</font>

284
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he'd never choose a place like this.</font>

285
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There must be something fishy going on.</font>

286
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just wait right here.</font>

287
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I refuse to believe he won't come out.</font>

288
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shangxue Academy]</font>

289
00:14:22,060 --> 00:14:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

290
00:14:26,730 --> 00:14:30,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

291
00:14:30,780 --> 00:14:35,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

292
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:38,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

293
00:14:39,230 --> 00:14:43,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

294
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:47,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>

295
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:54,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I only wish to see you more than once♪</font>

296
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We hold each other in our hearts♪</font>

297
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:04,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Unafraid of being separated
by the Magpie Bridge♪</font>

298
00:15:04,950 --> 00:15:07,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Above us, brilliant stars fill the sky♪</font>

299
00:15:07,950 --> 00:15:12,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright and lingering in your eyes♪</font>

300
00:15:13,470 --> 00:15:16,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪If you could see it too♪</font>

301
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:21,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Tiptoe amid the vast sea of faces♪</font>

302
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:25,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'll come flying to your side♪</font>

303
00:15:25,110 --> 00:15:28,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'll rush there without delay♪</font>

304
00:15:30,420 --> 00:15:33,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To stay together in our hearts♪</font>

305
00:15:33,970 --> 00:15:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Unafraid of being separated
by the Magpie Bridge♪</font>

306
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Above us, brilliant stars fill the sky♪</font>

307
00:15:42,180 --> 00:15:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright and lingering in your eyes♪</font>

308
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

309
00:15:52,210 --> 00:15:53,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

310
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:57,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

311
00:15:57,800 --> 00:16:02,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

312
00:16:02,480 --> 00:16:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

313
00:16:06,470 --> 00:16:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

314
00:16:10,990 --> 00:16:15,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

315
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:20,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

316
00:16:23,460 --> 00:16:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

317
00:16:28,130 --> 00:16:31,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

318
00:16:32,180 --> 00:16:36,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

319
00:16:36,730 --> 00:16:39,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

320
00:16:40,700 --> 00:16:44,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

321
00:16:45,310 --> 00:16:49,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
